      "statement": "GitHub App installation tokens are minted by signing a short-lived RS256 JWT with the App private key and exchanging it for an installation access token, cached in-process by a scope key of installation id, repository ids/names, and permissions, and reused until within a 10-minute margin of expiry that exceeds the proxy refresh window.",
